('G5177','grc','τυγχάνω','tugchanō','G:V','to obtain/happen','τυγχάνω 
 [in LXX: Deu.19:5 (מָצָא), Job.3:21 7:2 17:1, Pro.30:23 (without definite Heb. equiv.), Wis.15:19, 1Ma.11:42, 3Ma.3:7, al. ;] 
__I. Trans. 
