7) wife of Hezron
8) mother of Hezekiah (cf H021)'),
('H0029I','hbo','אֲבִיָּ֫הוּ, אֲבִיָּה','a.viy.yah','N:N-M-P','Abijah','A king of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ki.14.31; 
